# Keep the serverless bundle small and free of anything secret.
#
# Patterns are anchored with a leading slash: a bare `storage` also matches
# backend/app/storage and silently breaks the import.

# Never ship credentials. The platform injects env vars; a .env in the bundle is a
# second, stale copy of them sitting on the function's filesystem.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

/storage
/docs
/data/artwork
/frontend/dist
/frontend/cms/dist
/frontend/viewer/dist
/backend/.venv
/backend/tests
/backend/tools
/backend/alembic
/backend/scripts
/.claude
/.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
